abstract: >-
  Two separately versioned, provenance-controlled releases for
  manufacturing-constrained composite laminate design and thermographic
  inspection. NEX-Laminate contains deterministic CLT labels and T-COMP-PT
  contains an attributed thermogram-mask benchmark and an external sequence
  registry.

